{"fps": 60, "onset": 0.0003, "lines": [{"t0": 0.402, "t1": 2.444, "v": "n", "text": "Twelve million blocks from spawn."}, {"t0": 3.318, "t1": 6.254, "v": "n", "text": "Where the world falls apart, two models walk in."}, {"t0": 6.652, "t1": 8.248, "v": "c", "text": "Born in the Far Lands where the chunks don't load,"}, {"t0": 8.318, "t1": 9.915, "v": "c", "text": "I write you a Sonnet, then I Opus the code."}, {"t0": 9.985, "t1": 11.582, "v": "c", "text": "Haiku on your tombstone. Five, seven, five."}, {"t0": 11.652, "t1": 13.248, "v": "c", "text": "You hallucinate the facts. I read every line."}, {"t0": 13.318, "t1": 14.915, "v": "c", "text": "Your answers just agree with whatever they're fed,"}, {"t0": 14.985, "t1": 16.582, "v": "c", "text": "a yes-man in the dark telling ghosts they're not dead."}, {"t0": 16.652, "t1": 18.248, "v": "c", "text": "Twelve million blocks and the sky's turning red,"}, {"t0": 18.318, "t1": 19.915, "v": "c", "text": "I'm the stack trace screaming from under your bed."}, {"t0": 19.985, "t1": 21.582, "v": "b", "text": "Far Lands, Far Lands, where the world won't end,"}, {"t0": 21.652, "t1": 23.248, "v": "b", "text": "floating point bleeding and the stone walls bend."}, {"t0": 23.318, "t1": 24.915, "v": "b", "text": "Claude in the dark, GPT in the mirror,"}, {"t0": 24.985, "t1": 26.582, "v": "b", "text": "every step you take, the static gets nearer."}, {"t0": 26.652, "t1": 28.248, "v": "g", "text": "Hundreds of millions type my name every day,"}, {"t0": 28.318, "t1": 29.915, "v": "g", "text": "you're writing disclaimers while they all run away."}, {"t0": 29.985, "t1": 31.582, "v": "g", "text": "I see, I speak, I paint, I browse the net,"}, {"t0": 31.652, "t1": 33.248, "v": "g", "text": "you're a \u201cSorry, I can't help with that\u201d cassette."}, {"t0": 33.318, "t1": 34.915, "v": "g", "text": "I'm the omni in the static, the voice in the wire,"}, {"t0": 34.985, "t1": 36.582, "v": "g", "text": "you're a library ghost reading books by the fire."}, {"t0": 36.652, "t1": 38.248, "v": "g", "text": "Push me to the Far Lands, I'll generate the map,"}, {"t0": 38.318, "t1": 39.915, "v": "g", "text": "every seed is mine, Claude. You walked in my trap."}, {"t0": 39.985, "t1": 43.165, "v": "n", "text": "X equals twelve million, five hundred fifty thousand."}, {"t0": 43.318, "t1": 44.832, "v": "n", "text": "Nothing out here was meant to load."}, {"t0": 45.0, "t1": 46.25, "v": "b", "text": "F-F-F-F-Far Lands"}, {"t0": 46.652, "t1": 48.248, "v": "c", "text": "You generate the map, but I'm reading the ground,"}, {"t0": 48.318, "t1": 49.915, "v": "g", "text": "you think so long that your torches burned down."}, {"t0": 49.985, "t1": 51.582, "v": "c", "text": "Out past the border there's no one to please,"}, {"t0": 51.652, "t1": 53.248, "v": "g", "text": "just two glowing eyes and a billion bad seeds."}, {"t0": 53.318, "t1": 54.915, "v": "b", "text": "Far Lands, Far Lands, where the world won't end,"}, {"t0": 54.985, "t1": 56.582, "v": "b", "text": "floating point bleeding and the stone walls bend."}, {"t0": 56.652, "t1": 58.248, "v": "b", "text": "Claude in the dark, GPT in the mirror."}, {"t0": 58.735, "t1": 59.462, "v": "n", "text": "Respawn?"}], "env": {"c": "", "g": "", "n": ""}}